WEBVTT

00:00.280 --> 00:02.280
Method of taking Samayik

00:02.280 --> 00:06.680
First place your right hand in front of
Sthapana Charyaji,

00:06.680 --> 00:08.720
and recite the Navkar Mantra and
Pachindiya.

00:08.720 --> 00:10.840
Then, by giving a Khamasamana,

00:10.840 --> 00:14.320
Icchami Khamasamano Vandiu Javanijjae
Nisihiae,

00:14.320 --> 00:15.720
Matthaena Vandami.

00:20.000 --> 00:22.840
recite Iriyavahiyam, Tassa Uttari, Annattha sutra

00:23.200 --> 00:28.040
then in the Kausagg Mudra
Chant 1 Logassa (untill Chandesu Nimmalayara)

00:28.360 --> 00:29.720
If you don't know,

00:29.720 --> 00:31.880
then chant four Navkar Mantras in Kausagg Mudra

00:31.880 --> 00:33.960
then recite Logassa

00:34.280 --> 00:38.600
then, Icchami Khamasamano Vandiu
Javanijjae Nisihiae,

00:38.600 --> 00:40.360
Matthaena Vandami.

00:44.000 --> 00:46.360
Ichchakaren Sandish Bhagwan

00:46.360 --> 00:49.200
Samayik Muhapatti Padilehu? Ichcham.

00:49.200 --> 00:50.200
having said this,

00:50.320 --> 00:53.200
recite Muhaptti ke 50 bol

01:02.000 --> 01:06.480
then, Icchami Khamasamano Vandiu
Javanijjae Nisihiae,

01:06.480 --> 01:08.000
Matthaena Vandami.

01:11.520 --> 01:13.720
Ichchakaren Sandish Bhagwan

01:13.720 --> 01:16.280
Samayik Sadisahu? Ichchham

01:16.280 --> 01:19.800
Icchami Khamasamano Vandiu Javanijjae
Nisihiae,

01:19.800 --> 01:21.440
Matthaena Vandami.

01:25.480 --> 01:27.720
Ichchakaren Sandish Bhagwan

01:27.720 --> 01:29.880
Samayik Thau? Ichchham

01:29.880 --> 01:31.040
Saying this,

01:31.040 --> 01:33.600
fold your hands and
count 1 Navkar Mantra

01:33.600 --> 01:34.920
Ichhakari Bhagwan

01:34.920 --> 01:37.600
Passay Kari Samayik
Dandak Uchchrav Shoji

01:37.800 --> 01:41.240
Saying this, with both hands joined
on the forehead,

01:41.240 --> 01:44.440
chant 1 Navakar and recite Karemi Bhante

01:44.440 --> 01:48.640
then, Icchami Khamasamano Vandiu
Javanijjae Nisihiae,

01:48.640 --> 01:50.360
Matthaena Vandami.

01:55.080 --> 01:57.200
Ichchakaren Sandisah Bhagwan !

01:57.200 --> 01:59.600
Besane Sandisahu? Ichchham

01:59.600 --> 02:03.920
then, Icchami Khamasamano Vandiu
Javanijjae Nisihiae,

02:03.920 --> 02:05.320
Matthaena Vandami.

02:09.200 --> 02:11.360
Ichchakarena Sandisah Bhagawan!

02:11.360 --> 02:13.600
Besane Thau? Ichchham

02:13.600 --> 02:17.760
then, Icchami Khamasamano Vandiu
Javanijjae Nisihiae,

02:17.760 --> 02:19.440
Matthaena Vandami.

02:23.760 --> 02:25.760
Ichchakaren Sandisah Bhagwan!

02:25.760 --> 02:28.520
Sajjai Sandisah? Ichchham

02:28.520 --> 02:32.600
then, Icchami Khamasamano Vandiu
Javanijjae Nisihiae,

02:32.600 --> 02:34.120
Matthaena Vandami.

02:38.120 --> 02:40.480
Ichchakaren Sandisah Bhagwan!

02:40.480 --> 02:42.800
Sajjai Karu? Ichchham.

02:42.800 --> 02:45.280
Saying this, with joint hands

02:45.280 --> 02:47.600
chant the Navkar mantra three times.

02:47.600 --> 02:49.120
Then, for 48 minutes,

02:49.120 --> 02:52.080
meditate on Navkar and self-study.
